 * forward pass with ReLU on fixed inputs, the affine-collapse demonstration
 * (with vs without activation), and an activation-function table
 * (relu/sigmoid/tanh + sigmoid derivative). Every printed literal verified
 * under CPython 3. Deterministic only.
 */
